{"questions":[{"question_id":"pUvquwVZbI1KCOD2","paperTitle":"AIEEE 2004","year":2004,"examDate":2004,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"structure-of-atom","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"electronic-configuration-and-nodes","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"which-one-of-the-following-sets-of-ions-represents-the-colle-2004-marks-4-puvquwvzbi1kcod2.htm","content":"Which one of the following sets of ions represents the collection of isoelectronic species? (Atomic nos. : F = 9, Cl = 17, Na = 11, Mg = 12, Al = 13, K = 19, Ca = 20, Sc = 21)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"K<sup>+</sup>, Cl<sup>-</sup>, Mg<sup>2+</sup>, Sc<sup>3+</sup>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Na<sup>+</sup>, Ca<sup>2+</sup>, Sc<sup>3+</sup>, F<sup>-</sup>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"K<sup>+</sup>, Ca<sup>2+</sup>, Sc<sup>3+</sup>, Cl<sup>-</sup>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Na<sup>+</sup>, Mg<sup>2+</sup>, Al<sup>3+</sup>, Cl<sup>-</sup>"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"Isoelectronic means those species whose no of electrons are same. \n<br><br>\n<table class=\"tg\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-de48\">Ions</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-de48\">Atomic No</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-de48\">No of Electron</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">K<sup>+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">19</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">19-1=18</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">Ca<sup>+2</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">20</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">20-2=18</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">Sc<sup>+3</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">21</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">21-3=18</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">Cl<sup>-</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">17</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-wv9z\">17+1=18</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br><br>So, option <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.48ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1538 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1149,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is correct."}]}